# Switch the tricycle controller's exact mode: while enabled, traction is held
# until the steering error is below the threshold (instead of scaling down with
# the error as in normal driving).
bool enable
# Steering error [rad] below which traction is released while exact mode is
# enabled. 0.0 (unset) selects the controller's exact_mode_threshold parameter.
# Valid range (0, pi].
float64 threshold
---
bool success
string message
